{"name": "Lfan-ke/moonkoog", "version": "0.2.0", "readme": "README.md", "repository": "https://github.com/Lfan-ke/moonkoog", "license": "Apache-2.0", "keywords": ["koog", "agent", "llm", "tool-calling", "moonbit"], "description": "moonkoog \u2014 a MoonBit port of JetBrains Koog (1.1.1): a type-safe agent-orchestration framework. The prompt/message model, LLM client contract, tool registry with a JSON-schema descriptor model, and the AIAgent tool-calling loop (Koog's singleRunStrategy), built to compose with the moon-heke full-stack suite.", "deps": {"moonbitlang/async": "0.20.3", "DC-Z-lab/moonllm": "0.1.0"}, "checksum": "00b7b55725a03fe4cc5183a9cab6c1bdc16ee8dca53e4928f20cc6c9e90764b2", "created_at": "2026-08-04T14:06:53.224854+00:00"}
